        "id": 5395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-19T20:32:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This file doesn\u0027t actually get synced to G3. I only plan for there to be one version of this in G3 (it\u0027s the above pdf_writer) since all clients there want the JPEG helpers too. It seemed like it would be less churn than having to expand 1 dependency to 2 for those few clients. WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "734f676f_f1e7f3be",
      "revId": "bc926088b9e67f2ddf6032a0efb43909af30d198",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
